<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The importance of a purpose-driven team to any project cannot be overestimated. The resourceful team which kept me accountable, while doing their quota in ensuring the success of this book includes Precious Akintunde with whom I co-wrote this book. He has a lot of original ideas in various chapters of the book. The team of contributors and editors was led by Otiti Aburime  and includes Rachael Oyetade, Ifejesu Majua Odejide and Precious Abayowa who also did the design of this book. Most of the team are also co-instructors with me at The Wisdom Place, The House of Insights and other platforms where I minister.)
