483 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T ( Wisdom is  knowing what to do at each season of your life. There is a season for every purpose and there is a purpose for season. It is equally great wisdom to learn to discern the purpose of the seasons of your life. Whatever you are going through right now, good or bad, when you discern correctly the purpose of the season, you cooperate maximally with it and make maximum use of it. You may be going through a not-so-desirable season in your life but until you discover the purpose for it and co-operate with the purpose, you may be stuck in it. Sometimes, there are  lessons to pick, character and attitudes to develop, changes in thinking and lifestyle to imbibe, and/or skills to come out of difficult season. If you do not understand the purpose of the season but keep complaining about the season, the struggle continues until one understands the purpose for the season and does what they are supposed to do.  You may also be going through a great season in life, have you discovered the reason for the season? When the reason for a season is not known, the season is wasted. Wisdom is knowing what to do at each season of your life.)
/E ( Wisdom is  knowing what to do at each season of your life. There is a season for every purpose and there is a purpose for season. It is equally great wisdom to learn to discern the purpose of the seasons of your life. Whatever you are going through right now, good or bad, when you discern correctly the purpose of the season, you cooperate maximally with it and make maximum use of it. You may be going through a not-so-desirable season in your life but until you discover the purpose for it and co-operate with the purpose, you may be stuck in it. Sometimes, there are  lessons to pick, character and attitudes to develop, changes in thinking and lifestyle to imbibe, and/or skills to come out of difficult season. If you do not understand the purpose of the season but keep complaining about the season, the struggle continues until one understands the purpose for the season and does what they are supposed to do.  You may also be going through a great season in life, have you discovered the reason for the season? When the reason for a season is not known, the season is wasted. Wisdom is knowing what to do at each season of your life.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
484 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (In Gen 41, Pharaoh had a dream which Joseph interpreted to mean that there would be a season of abundance for seven years in Egypt followed by a season of famine for seven years. Joseph further advised that the purpose of the season of abundance was to save up for the season of dearth. The truth is that whether this counsel was taken or not, the seasons of abundance and famine would have come all the same. It took a man of wisdom to make them understand the purpose of the season of abundance. According to Gen41: 53 - 54, At last the seven years of bumper crops throughout the land of Egypt came to an end. Then the seven years of famine began, just as Joseph had predicted. The famine also struck all the surrounding countries, but throughout Egypt there was plenty of food. )
/E (In Gen 41, Pharaoh had a dream which Joseph interpreted to mean that there would be a season of abundance for seven years in Egypt followed by a season of famine for seven years. Joseph further advised that the purpose of the season of abundance was to save up for the season of dearth. The truth is that whether this counsel was taken or not, the seasons of abundance and famine would have come all the same. It took a man of wisdom to make them understand the purpose of the season of abundance. According to Gen41: 53 - 54, At last the seven years of bumper crops throughout the land of Egypt came to an end. Then the seven years of famine began, just as Joseph had predicted. The famine also struck all the surrounding countries, but throughout Egypt there was plenty of food. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
