487 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The preservation of an entire civilization was hinged on their understanding the purpose of a season. When people do not understand TIMES AND SEASONS OF LIFE, they suffer and struggle at best and die at the very worst.  There have been people who had a season of abundance in their lives but because they did not know the purpose of the season, they squandered the season and never recovered from the loss. It is wisdom to know the season for every purpose and activity in your life and it is even greater wisdom to know the purpose for every season of your life.)
/E (The preservation of an entire civilization was hinged on their understanding the purpose of a season. When people do not understand TIMES AND SEASONS OF LIFE, they suffer and struggle at best and die at the very worst.  There have been people who had a season of abundance in their lives but because they did not know the purpose of the season, they squandered the season and never recovered from the loss. It is wisdom to know the season for every purpose and activity in your life and it is even greater wisdom to know the purpose for every season of your life.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [0]
