<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Life is in phases and we must maximize every phase of life so that our overall life-journey results in success. It is our understanding of the phases of life that makes us know what we are supposed to do per time in life. 1 Chron. 12:32 talks about the men of Issachar, who understood the times and knew what Israel should do -200 chiefs, with all their relatives under their command \(NIV\). When people understand times and Seasons, they know what they should do at every time and they become commanders in life. )
