/S /H1
/T (Life coaches put this phase for the ideal life at age 0 to 25 years. This time range is fixed not to mean that once one has passed this age, the person cannot learn to position for success anymore. The time fixation is to create a sense of urgency. Indeed, if one has past this age and has not attained mastery in what one intends to be great at, one is running behind schedule and needs to be more urgent about developing the values needed for success. Subsequently, we will liken this phase to the morning time of life. )
