/T (3. The Retirement Phase of Life. This is the time to hand over to the next generation and be coaching from the sidelines. If death comes any time between 76 to 100 years, it should meet one fulfilled and having lived a full life. This is the night of life.  It is important to re-emphasize that the above categorization is not based on scriptures but life-coaches simply use this to give a greater understanding of life and what should be done per time. So, do not get into a needless race against time that you must do something by sometime by all means or feel defeated because you are at a certain age and certain things have not happened. A sense of urgency in life is different from a sense of desperation. )
