/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (God in His Wisdom created life to be in seasons because anything short of that would create a tiring life of hopelessness. Our advantage in life is in understanding the seasons of life - knowing what each season is meant for and using each season accordingly. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
515 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Every day has different seasons - the morning, the afternoon, the evening and the night. To have a great day, one must maximize all the seasons of the day. Thus, knowing what to do in the morning, how to maximize the afternoon, what is suited for the evening, and what is best done in the night, makes an entire day profitable.  )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
516 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (For example, it is important to create time to seek God in the morning and spiritually order the day aright. It is also vital to have a time carved out of every day when you feed your spirit, soul and mind with empowering information through books, messages, speeches or videos that fuel your drive towards your life goals. There should be ample time every day for productivity and working at things that moves you forward in your vision, career, and finances. Thus, work time is vital in every day. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
