/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Your day must have a time to exchange love with other people; give and receive love from family, friends and acquaintances. There should be a time for rest in each day. There should also be time carved out for impacting the world of people around you. Community outreach, getting involved in a ministry, serving in a church unit, being part of a social/humanitarian endeavor must have an allocated time in your life no matter how busy you are.  While touching lives and reaching out in impact to others should be ingrained in your everyday life, carrying out outreaches to others, getting involved in ministry service and other organized impact endeavors may not be every day for someone whose primary work is not related to such.)
/E (Your day must have a time to exchange love with other people; give and receive love from family, friends and acquaintances. There should be a time for rest in each day. There should also be time carved out for impacting the world of people around you. Community outreach, getting involved in a ministry, serving in a church unit, being part of a social/humanitarian endeavor must have an allocated time in your life no matter how busy you are.  While touching lives and reaching out in impact to others should be ingrained in your everyday life, carrying out outreaches to others, getting involved in ministry service and other organized impact endeavors may not be every day for someone whose primary work is not related to such.)
