/T (However, thinking one is too busy to have time to do something that involves serving God or touching lives around is a deception. The truth is that life is always busy, people must learn to create time for the priorities and what must be done.  The reason some people live an entire lifetime, absorbed in self, meeting up with the demands of life and having no one impacted as a legacy that they lived is because they do not understand that time for service to humanity, ministry and impact must be calculated into life, no matter how busy you are. )
