/T (Ask anyone in the noon and evening of their lives, they will tell you of some many legitimate demands of life that makes them not to have as much time for spiritual pursuits, retreats, programs, outreaches like during the morning of their lives. The people who are spiritually strong in the noon and evening of life are those that have developed a reservoir of spiritual grace in the morning of life.)
