550 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (2.   Discover your purpose and direction in life: Isa. 50:4 says the Lord God hath given me the tongue of the learned, that I should know how to speak a word in season to him that is weary: he waketh morning by morning, he waketh mine ear to hear as the learned. God wants you to hear every morning the instructions and guidance for the day. He even more wants you to hear early in the morning of life the instructions, guidance, and direction for your life. It is an untold advantage when you discover your purpose early in life; it sets your life on the right course and makes your decisions to be error free from the start of life. )
/E (2.   Discover your purpose and direction in life: Isa. 50:4 says the Lord God hath given me the tongue of the learned, that I should know how to speak a word in season to him that is weary: he waketh morning by morning, he waketh mine ear to hear as the learned. God wants you to hear every morning the instructions and guidance for the day. He even more wants you to hear early in the morning of life the instructions, guidance, and direction for your life. It is an untold advantage when you discover your purpose early in life; it sets your life on the right course and makes your decisions to be error free from the start of life. )
