/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (This is the reason it is important to do what is most important in the day and invest the best part of your energy into what matters most early in life. The strength for work in the evening is not the same as in the day - the morning and noon. Furthermore, when the night comes, it is time to sleep. This is the reason Jesus said, I must work the works of him that sent me, while it is day: the night cometh, when no man can work \(John 9:4\).)
/E (This is the reason it is important to do what is most important in the day and invest the best part of your energy into what matters most early in life. The strength for work in the evening is not the same as in the day - the morning and noon. Furthermore, when the night comes, it is time to sleep. This is the reason Jesus said, I must work the works of him that sent me, while it is day: the night cometh, when no man can work \(John 9:4\).)
