/S /H1
/T (For example, God predestined that Divinity would come to the earth, born by a virgin without sin, and would deliver humanity from sin and Satan. That was an end to be achieved; every other thing that happened from the fall of man to the coming of Jesus was a means to that end. Every man and woman that played a role from Adam to Abraham to David to the ascension of Jesus Christ in the story of Redemption did so based on their choices. If they did not, God would have passed through someone else to get the preordination of salvation fulfilled because the story was predestined to be fulfilled.)
/E (For example, God predestined that Divinity would come to the earth, born by a virgin without sin, and would deliver humanity from sin and Satan. That was an end to be achieved; every other thing that happened from the fall of man to the coming of Jesus was a means to that end. Every man and woman that played a role from Adam to Abraham to David to the ascension of Jesus Christ in the story of Redemption did so based on their choices. If they did not, God would have passed through someone else to get the preordination of salvation fulfilled because the story was predestined to be fulfilled.)
