/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Jesus is coming back to restate the Kingdom on the earth and rule and reign with His saints. Satan and His cohorts will be judged and thrown into eternal damnation. A new earth and a new heaven will be made and we will rule over the systems of the earths as co-regents with Jesus Christ. All these are predestined event but the roles, timings and alignment of individuals and systems is based on their choices. )
