625 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (God has infinite ways and possibilities in His Infinite-Mind on how each end result can be achieved. Thus, He preordains events and people into roles in order to achieve His predestined end. However, if anyone is not aligned by their choices along the path of predestination, they have not hurt the plan; they have only denied themselves the privilege of being part of the plan. There are infinite options of people and events that God can pass through as means to His predestined end. Because He is God - all the means are programmed into His predestination from the onset so there is a predestined role for everyone but not cast-in-stone for them.)
/E (God has infinite ways and possibilities in His Infinite-Mind on how each end result can be achieved. Thus, He preordains events and people into roles in order to achieve His predestined end. However, if anyone is not aligned by their choices along the path of predestination, they have not hurt the plan; they have only denied themselves the privilege of being part of the plan. There are infinite options of people and events that God can pass through as means to His predestined end. Because He is God - all the means are programmed into His predestination from the onset so there is a predestined role for everyone but not cast-in-stone for them.)
