<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (God predestines end results but the means is subject to change based on the choices of the persons involved. Thus, the predetermined purpose of God will be achieved even if the human agents have to be substituted. We should understand that, just like in a ball game, God has infinite capable substitutes to play every role in his scheme.  )
