657 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Many scriptures point to the fact that Jesus was predestined to die on the cross. Acts 2: 23 says, Jesus, being delivered by the predetermined purpose and foreknowledge of God, you have taken by lawless hands, have crucified, and put to death \(NLT\). It was predestined that Jesus Christ would die on the cross and that one of His twelve disciples would be the one to betray him to his death. Thus, Jesus in John 17: 12 says, during my time here, I protected them by the power of the name you gave me. I guarded them so that not one was lost, except the one headed for destruction, as the Scriptures foretold. )
/E (Many scriptures point to the fact that Jesus was predestined to die on the cross. Acts 2: 23 says, Jesus, being delivered by the predetermined purpose and foreknowledge of God, you have taken by lawless hands, have crucified, and put to death \(NLT\). It was predestined that Jesus Christ would die on the cross and that one of His twelve disciples would be the one to betray him to his death. Thus, Jesus in John 17: 12 says, during my time here, I protected them by the power of the name you gave me. I guarded them so that not one was lost, except the one headed for destruction, as the Scriptures foretold. )
/Pg 54 0 R
/K [4]
