691 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T ( So, if you have discovered your destiny, you also have to choose how far you want to go in fulfilling it.  For instance, if a person who is predestined to go into academics but due to nonchalance and wrong choices finishes school with a pass, that person may be limited more than someone who graduated with a first class. Also, if two people are called into the academia and one chooses to make the sacrifices to bag a doctoral degree, he will go further that the person who stopped at a first degree. God ordains but people decide. In essence, direction is a destiny discovery. Achievement, success and greatness in such discovery are parameters of choice. When you discover and understand your destiny, choices and decisions of life become easier. Whether marriage choices or profession choices, all is premised on the purpose discovered.)
/E ( So, if you have discovered your destiny, you also have to choose how far you want to go in fulfilling it.  For instance, if a person who is predestined to go into academics but due to nonchalance and wrong choices finishes school with a pass, that person may be limited more than someone who graduated with a first class. Also, if two people are called into the academia and one chooses to make the sacrifices to bag a doctoral degree, he will go further that the person who stopped at a first degree. God ordains but people decide. In essence, direction is a destiny discovery. Achievement, success and greatness in such discovery are parameters of choice. When you discover and understand your destiny, choices and decisions of life become easier. Whether marriage choices or profession choices, all is premised on the purpose discovered.)
/Pg 63 0 R
/K [1]
>>
