/T (So before you boast that you got born again in 1965 before the pastor was born, what impact have you made for the kingdom? How far have you gone in fulfilling your Kingdom purpose? At what spiritual heights are you operating now based on the results you are commanding in the realm of life for the Kingdom? These parameters are what measure progress in the spirit and not the passage of chronological time. Age, in the realm of the spirit and in life, is measured by progressive growth, impact and attainment, not by the passage of time. )
