<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (A common mistake in life is people wishing and praying for a great life while neglecting to greatly utilize the season of life they are in. A great live is simply a sum total of greatness of each season of life. There is no how that one can make something great out of life in the absence of a profound understanding of all ramifications of time in life as portrayed in this book. Healthy relationship with time in all its ramifications is a principal determinant of success and fulfillment in life. )
/E (A common mistake in life is people wishing and praying for a great life while neglecting to greatly utilize the season of life they are in. A great live is simply a sum total of greatness of each season of life. There is no how that one can make something great out of life in the absence of a profound understanding of all ramifications of time in life as portrayed in this book. Healthy relationship with time in all its ramifications is a principal determinant of success and fulfillment in life. )
